sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API
    participant Q as Queue
    participant W as Worker
    C->>A: Submit document
    activate A
    A->>Q: Enqueue job
    Q-->>A: Job identifier
    A-->>C: Accepted
    deactivate A
    loop Until acknowledged
        Q->>W: Deliver job
        alt Valid document
            W->>W: Build search entry
            W-->>Q: Acknowledge
        else Invalid document
            W-->>Q: Reject with reason
        end
    end
    Note over Q,W: Delivery may be repeated
